invalid type: string "5 June 2025\n\nGESH IITB, Centre for Climate Studies, ESED, DSSE, IIC\n\n21\n\n1–4 members per team\n\n31\n\n50\n\nHPCL-IITB Energy Transition Challenge\n\nDesigned to bring together students, startups, researchers, and HPCL professionals to co-create practical and scalable solutions for decarbonizing refinery operations and advancing the net-zero transition.\nnactivities\n